00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.380
disability services.

172
00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:33.380
Yeah.

173
00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:37.140
So anything basically that's to do with health care and you're right.

174
00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:38.140
Okay.

175
00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:39.140
Gotcha.

176
00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:43.860
That's a huge number of different professions and organisations, presumably there's also

