00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:48.780
a huge array of complaints that come across the HDC's desk as well.

178
00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.540
What are some that you can think of?

179
00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:57.140
So things like ambulances not arriving on time and home care is not turning up for work.

180
00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:04.780
To care for someone, pharmacists, mucking up prescriptions, all sorts of things.

