00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.700
That would all fall under what the HDC has oversight on.

188
00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:32.700
Yeah.

189
00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:34.100
And basically you're right as a patient.

190
00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.100
Right.

191
00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.700
So what are your rights as a patient?

192
00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:37.700
Yeah.

193
00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:41.380
So there's 10 rights in the code of rights.

194
00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:46.900
So just to sum up, it's like you need to have dignity when you're receiving your health

195
00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:47.980
