196
00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:52.700
You need to be fully informed about your care, so strong communication skills and that you

197
00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:56.020
can give consent and you have given consent for your treatment.

198
00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:02.260
So there's a bunch of things that you are kind of protected as like also kind of like

199
00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.820
a consumer of receiving this health care.

200
00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.780
And all of those I'm assuming are on the Health and Disability Commission website so you can go

201
00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.420
