209
00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:43.980
But then out of those 180 there are investigated about 75% of those are held for breaching code

210
00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:44.980
of rights.

211
00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:45.980
Okay.

212
00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:46.980
Cool.

