00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.380
breached that code.

238
00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.380
What happens then?

239
00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:19.700
So a lot of the time they will make the service or practitioner apologise to the family or

240
00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:26.100
